  "notable_quotes": [
    "The reported CO2/Xe selectivity is thermodynamic and IAST-based, so its applicability to multicomponent breakthrough conditions is conditional.",
    "Adsorption-site and binding analyses relied on rigid-framework GCMC and single-guest locate simulations using Coulomb and LJ potentials.",
    "CUPMOF-5 shows a CO2 uptake of 75.5 cm3 g−1 at 100 kPa under pure CO2 flow."
